    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Dr. Sachchidananda Sinha was the temporary President, whereas Dr. Rajendra Prasad was elected as the permanent President of the Constituent Assembly.",
        "Sir B.N. Rau was appointed as the Constitutional Advisor (Legal Advisor) to the Constituent Assembly.",
        "January 26 was specifically chosen as the date of enforcement of the Constitution to commemorate 'Purna Swaraj Day' declared in 1930."
      ],
      "id": "1cx0hgu"
